SUMMARY:48th Annual HBMS Mushroom Fair
LOCATION:Arcata Community Center\, 321 Community Park Way\, Arcata\, CA
DESCRIPTION:Humboldt Bay Mycological Society's biggest event of the year. 
 Your ticket includes mushroom displays of hundreds of fresh local species
 \, a raffle and food drive (bring nonperishable food for Food for People 
 to earn up to 10 raffle tickets)\, vendors and food trucks\, a kids' scav
 enger hunt with free prizes while supplies last\, and workshops and talks
  on mushroom identification\, cultivation and more. Proceeds support scho
 larships\, speaker honoraria and educational events.
